# Compiler (`@nucleify/compiler`)

IR-first portable UI compiler (`.nuc.tsx` → Vue + React emit).

## Conventions

- Source: `compiler/src/`
- Tests: `compiler/tests/`
- Fixtures: `compiler/fixtures/`
- Keep compiler logic self-contained — do not import from `root/`, `admin/`, `docs/`
- Rules: `compiler/.config/rules/`
- Agents: `root/.cursor/agents/`
